                    "text": "The real issue? Decades of government-enabled Big Pharma monopolies and ACA subsidies that prioritize insurer profits over affordability. Premium spikes stem from systemic corruption\u2014not tariffs aimed at reshoring medical manufacturing.\n\nThe Big Beautiful Bill (H.R. 1) slashes bureaucratic bloat funding these scams. Democrats had four years to fix pricing but instead expanded Medicaid fraud.\n\nTrump\u2019s strategy: expose the middlemen inflating costs, cut red tape, and let competition drive prices down. Washington\u2019s failure isn\u2019t inaction\u2014it\u2019s actively protecting a rigged system.\n\nSee how entrenched interests keep healthcare broken\u2014full details here: https://t.co/8apun0DI1H",
